{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"宜蘭縣政府（以下簡稱本府）為將本縣內各類農、林、畜牧、養殖業暨休閒農業設施（以下簡稱農業設施）建築物，依建築物使用類組及變更使用辦法第二條規定之使用類別、組別辦理分類(組)，特訂定本原則。","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000094/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"7e21eb41662d76414d3e99b2f555eefe74e8f7a2cd4fea6d0b6d8cf1233168ac","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"農業設施建築物之使用類(組)別如附表；附表未規定者由本府建設處會同農業處認定之。\n\n圖表附件：農業設施建築物之使用類〈組〉別.doc","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000094/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"70c6eee5781fe219d15660b4776a0ce1dce52aa4213f3d41c80f24dcfa7e6a38","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第三點","path":[],"text":"本原則奉 縣長核定後實施，修正時亦同。","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000094/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"e4ba651d59a66580789df17a778ae54730765a35721209b64622f494c92bbf8d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"農業設施建築物之使用類〈組〉別.doc","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=783&id=GL000094&type=LAW"}],"category":"農業與山坡地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"宜蘭縣-GL000094","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"宜蘭縣農、林、畜牧、養殖業暨休閒農業設施建築物使用類組認定原則","region":"宜蘭縣","source":"宜蘭縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000094","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:39+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"970513f0d74c50dbbeac467af66927def2eb40fff0190b94ec8c618698e0e162","sourceRecordId":"宜蘭縣-GL000094","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}